window.products.push({"id":1165052,"name":"DUTOUE Heat Resistant BBQ Gloves,Food Grade Kitchen Oven Mitts,Professional Silicone Non-Slip Flexible Oven Gloves for Grilling,Baking,Welding(1 Pair,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DvXaUxf-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality:Our heat insulated oven gloves consists of 5 layers of different materials and functions.The first layer is made of soft and durable non-toxic silicone.Second layer ultra-high strength aramid fiber for high heat,cut,acid and alkali resistance.Third layer polyester cotton for double protection & comfortable.Premium heat resistant oven gloves protect you and your family. Extreme Heat Resistant & Cut Resistant:The oven mitts can stably provide the ultra protection against heat up to 1472℉ (800℃),which are awarded also with the highest,EN388 cut resistance.Dimensions: length 13 inch(33 cm),width 6.7 inch(16 cm).Durable and extra long to protect your hands and forearms from burns when using the grill or oven racks. Easy To Use:Each piece is crafted with flexible and durable silicone.Our oven gloves have textured non-slip silicone design,five fingers apart design,make them ideal for moving or holding hot pans,plates,utensils or dishwareand and ensure your object would not slip from your hands.Provides good control and stability at high temperatures. Easy to wear,Clean & Store:The grill gloves are soft and comfortable.There is no difference between the right or left hand of the grilling gloves,you can wear on both sides.The large size fits most men's and women's hands.Hook design,easy to hang and store,save space.Stain resistant and easily cleanable,with just some warm water & a little soap.Or just throw them into the washing machine. Satisfaction Guaranteed:We dedicate to provide ultra-quality protective grilling mitts set for customers.Apply to kitchen,oven,grill,barbecue,fireplace and heat/fire resistant purpose.If you have any question about these oven gloves,please contact us in time,we will solve the problem and provide the best customer service for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DvXaUxf-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUTOUE","source_asin":"B0892Z77CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892Z77CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892Z77CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165053,"name":"VHC Brands Dogs Poodle Print Cotton Burlap Farmhouse Decor Stenciled Square 16x16 Filled Pillow, 16\" x 16\", Natural Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IVBJ1jjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Invite a furry friend into the house with the 16x16 Poodle Filled Pillow. The portrait of your favorite canine is stenciled on in jet black on burlap for a vintage farmhouse look. The friendly poodle has a serious expression to complement the antique feel of the accent pillow. FEATURES Natural burlap base fabric Natural burlap base fabric Stenciled jet black poodle face Stenciled jet black poodle face Pillow features a lightweight poly lining to keep the pillow from distorting shape and the pillow insert from showing through the open weave Pillow features a lightweight poly lining to keep the pillow from distorting shape and the pillow insert from showing through the open weave Turned edge seam Turned edge seam Reverses to natural burlap fabric Reverses to natural burlap fabric Features 2 light wooden button closures plus 1 spare hidden button with 4\" overlap to conceal pillow insert Features 2 light wooden button closures plus 1 spare hidden button with 4\" overlap to conceal pillow insert Single fabric: Machine stitched Single fabric: Machine stitched SPECIFICATIONS Dimensions: H16\"xW16\"xD Dimensions: H16\"xW16\"xD Weight: 1.2 lb Weight: 1.2 lb Material: 100% cotton shell, 100% polyester fill Material: 100% cotton shell, 100% polyester fill Components: 1 pillow cover w/ polyester fill insert Components: 1 pillow cover w/ polyester fill insert Manufacturer Country: India Manufacturer Country: India Care: Machine wash in cold water with like colors, gentle cycle. No chlorine bleach. Do not tumble dry. Iron if needed. Care: Machine wash in cold water with like colors, gentle cycle. No chlorine bleach. Do not tumble dry. Iron if needed. COLORS AVAILABLE - Specific Colors: Terrier - natural, jet black Terrier - natural, jet black Pug - natural, jet black Pug - natural, jet black Poodle - natural, jet black Poodle - natural, jet black Pit Bull - natural, jet black Pit Bull - natural, jet black * The description above varies by selected color. Please reference images and specific colors for clarification.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IVBJ1jjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B01IAAA3ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IAAA3ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IAAA3ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165054,"name":"CDN Digital Egg timer, Pearl Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jVxhiL0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CDN egg timer counts either up or down in both seconds and minutes to a maximum of 100 minutes. It's easy to use; just twist the base to set the time, then press the stop/start button on the top to begin counting. You can interrupt the counting with a touch of the stop/start button, then resume with another touch. When the easy-to-read digital display reaches zero, it sounds the alarm, then begins counting up. To shut off the alarm, simply touch the start/stop button and the last time counted will be displayed. The CDN digital egg timer stands 4-inchs tall and is available in pearl red, or pearl white. AAA battery and instructions are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jVxhiL0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CDN","source_asin":"B00GFHXIS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GFHXIS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GFHXIS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165055,"name":"Tulip by Martha Guerra, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+5umrZVML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features tulips. Martha Guerra found her passion in the wings of the ballet stage, capturing the fight, twirl or spin of the dancers. He found the compexity and grace of dance exhilirating and she fell in love. As as wife and a mother, she documents every milestone, as a photographer she documents life...memories to be tresured for years to come and with that comes immorality through art. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+5umrZVML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0Z2J8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0Z2J8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0Z2J8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
