window.products.push({"id":1165069,"name":"Huogary Milk Frother, 4-in-1 Electric Automatic Milk Steamer and Hot Chocolate Maker Machine with Detachable Stainless Steel Milk Jug- Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H7r4O9ijL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[LARGE CAPACITY MILK JUG]: Huogary electric milk frother is committed to producing larger capacity jug for heating milk 13.5oz or chocolate milk 10oz. For frothing milk, it holds 6.76oz milk to double milk into the super-dense foam for a perfect cup of cappuccinos. Note: Please use Whole Milk (Fat content>3%) for ideal milk froth. [Multi-function in One Machine]: Huogary 4-in-1 electric milk frother can create thick and creamy froth, heated milk and hot chocolate. You can melt some chocolate bars (less than 34g) with milk then turn to hot cocoa and mochaccino. Or easily make milk froth for your cappuccino, latte, macchiato, iced coffee. [Premium Quality and Dishwasher Safety]: Designed in Germany. Stylish design made of food-grade stainless steel, durable and conducts heat quickly. Angled ergonomic spout minimizes spillages. Dishwasher-safe milk jug, which can be easily removed from the base and wash in the dishwasher. [Advanced Induction Design]: The Milk Frother is powered by magnetic force, this innovative induction heating & frothing technology can heat the milk without causing milk burns and dry burning protection. The inside of the base is provided with a drainage hole and an external heat resistance system to protect the safe use of the equipment. [Safety Protection and Warranty]: ETL approved. For safety protection, the milk steamer will stop once the jug separated from the base. All Huogary products offer a 1-Year Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H7r4O9ijL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huogary","source_asin":"B08M5M9BYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M5M9BYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M5M9BYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
