window.products.push({"id":1165106,"name":"Golden Fortune Coin & Money Toad/Frog/Jin Chan 三足金蟾 - Feng Shui Chinese Charm of Prosperity Decoration Gift (Idea for Office Desk, Computer, Book Shel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mZcqzF-AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Jin Chan (Chinese: 金蟾; literally: \"Golden Toad\"), also called Chan Chu , is most commonly translated as \"Money Toad\" or \"Money Frog\". It represents a popular Feng Shui charm for prosperity. This mythical creature is said to appear during the full moon, near houses or businesses that will soon receive good news (most of the time, the nature of this good news is understood to be wealth-related). The Jin Chan is usually depicted as a bullfrog with red eyes, flared nostrils and only one hind leg (for a total of three legs), sitting on a pile of traditional Chinese cash, with a coin in its mouth. On its back, it often displays seven diamond spots . According to Feng Shui beliefs, Jin Chan helps attract and protect wealth, and guards against bad luck. Because it symbolizes the flow of money, Feng Shui lore insists that a Jin Chan statue should not be positioned facing the main door (\"outward\"). It also \"should never be kept in the bathroom, bedroom, dining room or kitchen\" Material: Resin. Color: Gold . Size : 2.5\" L x 2\" W x 1.5\" H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mZcqzF-AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mose Cafolo","source_asin":"B07NDP7JM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NDP7JM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NDP7JM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
