window.products.push({"id":1165124,"name":"9.45inch Heat Diffuser Stainless Steel Induction Diffuser Plate for Electric Gas Stove Glass Induction Cooktop Heat Diffuser Cooking Induction Adapter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oAt8Da1mL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Do you have a skillet or old cookware that you were going to give up? With our induction plate, you can keep it and use it with your induction burner.It makes it possible to use any cookware on an induction stove, it can make your non-induction cookware compatible with your induction cooktop. Product Features · High quality heat diffuser plate used to heat non-inductive pans evenly· Work with any pot or pan so you won't have to buy induction specific cookware· Lightweight and durable, energy saving technology, protect your cookware from damage· The induction adapter plate can also be used as a gas hob trivet stabilizer no matter how small the pan is· This will work as a heat diffuse unless your induction cooktop has a surface-temperature sensor, in which case it will trigger an overheat error Notice · This product can not be contacted with food directly. Please do not put food directly on the plate· It takes time to get up to temperature, so the induction plate is not suitable for boiling water or ultra-high temperature cooking· Do not use cold water to wash the hot plate, in case the plate would be bursting or swelling that they can not be used normally· After the power off, the afterheat will maintain at least ten minutes, do not touch the product directly with your hands before its completely chill Questions & Answers Q: Can the diffuser plate be used on a gas stove?A: Yes, it can be used on gas ranges, electric stove, induction cooktop, also can be used on a glass stovetop. Q: Can the diffuser plate be used for cast iron pan on a glass top stove?A: Yes, it works great! Use it on your glass/ceramic top induction cooktop to cook with non-induction pans Q: Does plates have a \"stay cool\" handle?A: Yes, the handle stays cool. But you should be carefully while using. Q: Does the Diffuser smell when hot?A: No smells.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oAt8Da1mL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOZYER","source_asin":"B0BXV1YYM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXV1YYM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXV1YYM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
