window.products.push({"id":1165195,"name":"Modern Pop Art Girl Bla Bla Canvas Wall Art Picture Print (12x8)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610GY8AHXVL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Make a statement. Set the mood. Pull your room together with wall art prints that pop. Bring your walls to life with a canvas print that suits your style. Whether it’s beautiful photography, pop art, calming scenes to soothe the soul, or something different entirely, you’ll find a print that grabs your attention and says ‘pick me!’. Have a look through our ever-growing selection—with a range of styles and sizes to choose from. You’ll be sure to find something that fits your personality just right. Designs that stand out, that complement, and help you tell your story. Canvas prints that suit you. We believe that your walls shouldn’t be boring, that your home should be a space that tells a story. Let us help you transform your spaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610GY8AHXVL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panther Print","source_asin":"B07BH2CVBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BH2CVBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BH2CVBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165196,"name":"Presse by bobble Coffee & Tea Maker, Press Coffee Maker, Travel Tumbler, Stainless Steel, On the Go Brewer, Brew Press & Go, Portable Coffee Brewer an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Swx0uTH3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Rise and Brew! Skip the waste and get your caffeine fix in style with Presse by bobble. The 2-piece stainless steel coffee press brews delicious coffee in just 3 minutes. Gourmet coffee couldn't be simpler - just brew, press and go. Directions: Step 1 -BREW: Just add medium-coarse freshly ground coffee and hot water to the outer tumbler. Step 2-PRESS: Wait for 3 minutes, then push down on the inner press. Step 3-GO: Enjoy coffee right from the Presse. Coffee stays hot and delicious for hours.  Our unique micro-filter separates grounds from finished coffee and traps them at the bottom to stop brewing immediately when pressed. No bitterness and no grounds in your teeth. Our 3 layers of insulation means your coffee stays hot for your morning commute and into your day. The best part? The outside stays cool to the touch. Care & Maintenance of your Presse: Super easy to clean. No flimsy screen that gets clogged with coffee grounds, no worries about breaking the glass part of your press. Presse is dishwasher safe. About bobble: Founded in 2010, we set out to satisfy our desire for fresh, tasty and portable water while keeping our wallets and planet happy. Disposable water won’t do that, so we decided to reinvent the water bottle. No problem! We needed our bottle to be reusable and resilient. We refused to sacrifice style in favor of function. We wanted water that tasted better. We wanted it all, and we wanted it now. And so, bobble was born. Since then the bobble family has expanded to bring you coffee, tea, and at-home products - all created with the idea that taste will always triumph over waste. At bobble, our mission is threefold. 1 – to bring style to everyday life, 2- to encourage health and fitness and 3) sustainability – we provide sleek, easy and impactful drinking solutions that help reduce single serve waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Swx0uTH3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bobble","source_asin":"B00T088TXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T088TXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T088TXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165197,"name":"UNITSTAGE Portable Closet Wardrobe Freestanding Closet Organizer with Shoe Rack for Hanging Clothes 77.4x11.8x66 Inches for Bedroom Living Room with P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81esjAf-yaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional storage space】UNITSTAGE portable closet wardrobe has a large storage open space design 77.4x11.8x66 inches, can store up to 34-40 pairs of shoes and boots and 5 pieces of coats or 10 pieces of short sleeves, the height can be adjusted according to Free assembly is required. You can also place unused bags, storage boxes and seasonal clothes according to your specific needs. 【Strong Bearing Capacity】This portable closet rack is supported by 0.6\" diameter tubing, a single tube has a load capacity of up to 30 lbs, won't deform easily, and reinforced plastic connectors enhance overall robustness. 【Durable & Sturdy】This freestanding portable closet rack is made of powder-coated metal tubes and high-quality plastic parts, and the powder-coated surface will not rust or corrode during normal use. L-shaped or in-line construction with a stable, strong and durable freestanding closet system. Provides easy access to bedrooms, cloakrooms, walk-in closets and more. 【Easy to Assemble】It is recommended to use a rubber hammer, one is provided in each package, it is effective to use and decompress. We have detailed installation instructions and installation instruction videos, and all accessories packaging bags are marked with labels and corresponding quantities. Before installation, please read the installation instructions carefully, which can help you assemble the closet rack quickly and easily. You can also invite your family to experience the fun of building blocks with the family version. 【Premium Service】 UNITSTAGE provides lifetime professional customer service. If the product is missing parts or parts are damaged, no matter the quantity, please feel free to contact us and we will arrange a new part or a full replacement as soon as possible! Product patent pending.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81esjAf-yaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNITSTAGE","source_asin":"B0BP6F6Z3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6F6Z3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6F6Z3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
