window.products.push({"id":1165274,"name":"LOGRRMTH 2Pcs Retractable Burger Fixed Box Adjustable Hamburger Holders Reusable Silicone Rack Holder Burger Box Sandwich Holder Suitable for Burger L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kxIk5O3kL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A burger lover's artifact: As a burger lover, the sauces and crumbs can make your hands and clothes greasy when you're enjoying a burger. With this perfect matching burger rack, you're perfectly free from the greasy, and you can enjoy it to the fullest. Have fun with burgers! Ergonomic Design: U-shaped notch, a cutout in the central part, exposes the maximum amount of food to the user's bite while providing adequate support. The flexible bottom can be squeezed or pushed up to bite into the last bite without unwanted contact. It is more economical and more environmentally friendly in the long run. Retractable: The retractable burger rack can be retracted on its own, allowing you to add more meat and other favorite condiments when eating burgers, and can also be used to hold juicy burgers, bagels, donuts, and more. High-quality material: The material is made of high-quality and safe silicone material, the surface is smooth, environmentally friendly and durable, heat-resistant and wear-resistant, not easy to be damaged or deformed, and can be reused. EASY TO CLEAN: The smooth surface of the burger rack is easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Don't worry about the sauce remaining in it and not easy to clean. Enjoy your burger.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kxIk5O3kL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOGRRMTH","source_asin":"B0B1PPRWW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1PPRWW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1PPRWW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
