window.products.push({"id":1165291,"name":"Ice Cube Trays 2 Pack, Easy-Release Silicone & Flexible 14-Ice Cube Trays with Spill-Resistant Removable Lid Easy Pop Release Molds Stackable Ice Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131yQ1xaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★100% SATISFACTION CUSTOMER SERVICE:If you receive the Wrong Size/Wrong items/Defective Product, please feel free to contact us for refund/replacement. And we desire to know your true ideas of all details about the items, so that we can do better at products&service. 🥤Effortless to release🧊 Compared with the previous hard plastic ice trays, the bottom of this silicone ice cube tray is made of soft silicone material and has good flexibility. Take out the frozen ice cubes from refrigerator, just rinse it with cold water or leave it for a minute, and ice cubes will be easliy released by pushing the soft bottom. 🥤Stronger & Safety🧊Made of premium silicone and PP material. Bpa-free and pass food-grade LFGB certification! Each tray makes 14 nice-sized cubes for a total of 56 (Each capacity of 27 ml). The ice trays are able to save room in freezer by stacking together. 🥤Easy Ice Removal:🧊Silicone ice cube trays with lid use TPE material and the bottom wider design, which makes it easy to release ice cubes and the soft silicone material will not break after freezing for a long time. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. No need for awkward bending or twisting, removing the ice cube isn't a tough job anymore! 🥤Suitable for Bar/ Home 🧊The ice cube is necessary in bar to cool cocktails, whiskey, tequila, vodka. And it is a useful tool at home for other homemade beverage or various ice snack like froze soup, ice cream or flower ice cube.Perfect for making ice cubes orfilling the trays with juice, fruit, jelly, chocolate, herbs, sauces andpudding and baby food purees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131yQ1xaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAOKE BOLE","source_asin":"B09KNT7BHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KNT7BHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KNT7BHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
