window.products.push({"id":1165449,"name":"Jack-o'-Lantern - Series 2 NEW - Horror Ornament - Scary Prop and Decoration for Halloween, Christmas, Parties and Events - Chad Savage Series - By Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SnI+OJ2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’re in for a spooky treat with HorrorNaments Jack-o'-Lantern Collectible Ornament! This creepy ornament is a spooky and fun way to celebrate the Halloween, Christmas or holiday season. Any Halloween lover or fan of horror will get a kick out of this sinister Jack-o'-Lantern. About This Product: - Jack-o'-Lantern Ornament- Collectible Item- Makes A Great Gift For Horror Enthusiasts- Metal Loop Accommodates Ornament Hooks & String For Hanging - Great For Halloween Decor, Haunted Attractions & Gift Shops CREEPY JACK-O'-LANTERN. Instead of baubles, why not try hanging something a little more sinister on your tree? This jack-o-lantern is a real classic and it provides the perfect spooky touch to any tree, so it’s great for those who want to add something creepy to their tree, but don’t want to go the whole hog. This ornament features a sturdy design that will last for seasons to come and features a metal loop on top to attach ornament hooks or string to so you can display it around your home for the holidays or in your haunted attraction. They are also great items for gift shops, particularly for Halloween and horror festivals and events. HORRORNAMENTS ARE THE PERFECT COLLECTIBLE FOR HALLOWEEN ENTHUSIASTS. HorrorNaments was created by a Halloween enthusiast and haunted attraction owner. They’re perfect for Halloween decor. The chilling detail and artistry will impress true fans of anything related to Halloween and horror. At HorrorNaments we are committed to celebrating the spirit and thrill of the scariest season by creating quality products we’re sure you will enjoy. If for any reason you aren’t completely satisfied with your purchase, contact us so that we can be of assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SnI+OJ2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HorrorNaments","source_asin":"B06XCTL4GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XCTL4GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XCTL4GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165450,"name":"Arkwright Decorative Bath Towel Set Paisley Design Cotton Soft Velour Towels | Pack of 6 Includes 2 Bath Towels, 2 Hand Towels & 2 Washcloths","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AMzgxCkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect accent to your unique style, our decorative towels set Accents De Bain Paisley Towel Set offers shades of green and blue in a soft, velour set for display and use. These elegant towels are perfect to for your guest bathrooms, powder rooms, and master bathrooms! These velour towels are super soft and use fiber-reactive printing technique to stay vibrant wash-after-wash. Set includes: Two Bath Towels 27\" x 54\" Two Bath Towels 27\" x 54\" Two Hand Towels 16\"x28\" Two Hand Towels 16\"x28\" Two washcloths 13\"x13\" Two washcloths 13\"x13\" Accent De Bain Decorative towel sets for your bathroom provide a soft, thin and functional fast dry solution for your bathroom decor! About US With roots established in 1947, Arkwright LLC manufactures high quality and value-priced textiles from manufacturers around the world. We leverage our insight, global network, and purchasing power to find the perfect blend of quality and price-point for the following industries: business, agriculture, environmental services, healthcare, hospitality JanSan and beyond! We appreciate your business and look forward to working with you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AMzgxCkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arkwright LLC","source_asin":"B07FGVGCGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FGVGCGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FGVGCGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165451,"name":"Wakasa Bijin Black Japanese Chopsticks; 1 Pair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+PQv39NIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This chopstick is an amazing work of art! Each chopstick is very labor intensive and can contain up to 50+ layers of lacquer. Wakasa nuri hashi - made in the Fukui prefecture, located along the coast of the Sea of Japan, since the Edo period. Craftsmen apply multiple layers of lacquer to each chopstick and depending on the style, may also incorporate small pieces of shell or mother of pearl to enhance the design. The final design of the chopsticks comes from how the lacquer coatings are carved in order to expose the layers. Carving can also determine the final shape of the chopstick. After carving the chopstick must be polished in order to bring out the beauty and colors of the lacquering. The Wakasa Bijin Black Japanese chopsticks are 9 inches in length with a special carved elongated end. Beautiful colors of black, red, gold and orange design. Made in Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+PQv39NIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EverythingChopsticks","source_asin":"B00BNKRB6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BNKRB6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BNKRB6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
