window.products.push({"id":1165488,"name":"Switol Manual Citrus Juicer Press, Commercial Orange and Lemon Juice Squeezer Extractor (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DmRE17lHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Our heavy-duty commercial citrus press extractor is perfect for restaurants,grocery stores, bars, fruit shops. It’s also a great christmas gift for family or friends who love to make healthy fresh juice regularly. Feature ★ Quickly and Easily Juicing ★ You can squeeze a glass of juice in 2 minutes. Just cut the fruit in half (without peeling),put the flat cut side down on the strainer, and press down the hammer. ★ Lifetime Use ★ Our pomegranate hand press juicer is made of stainless steel and cast iron with rust-proof coating on the surface. With normal usage, the manual juice squeezerwill last many years. ★ More Delicious Juice ★ Unlike the electric citrus juicer, the juice squeezed out by our manual orange esprimidor does not have the bitter taste of the citrus peel. The built-in strainer cup filters out all seeds, but also filters out some pulp. Taste like fruit pulp orange. If you don't like the pulp in your juice, you can use the complimentary wire strainer filtering out the pulp. Space Required Height: 15.5” for storing 28.5” for operating Length: 11.5” for storing 16.5” for operating Width: 7.25” Using Instructions ① Clean the orange squeezer carefully before first use. ② Check the stainless steel screws. If the screwis loose, tighten it with the attached wrench. ③ The manual juice press issuited to use on stable ground. ④ Insert the funnel into the hand press grapefruit juicer,theninsert the strainer and place a glass under the funnel. ⑤ Cut the fruit in half, put half of fruit on the strainer and slowly move the lever down until you squeeze out all the juice. ⑥ After a long-term use, tighten the screws, and lubricating the shaft and joints with olive oil or any other kind of kitchen oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DmRE17lHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Switol","source_asin":"B07VK2M7X2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VK2M7X2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VK2M7X2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
