window.products.push({"id":1165572,"name":"CHEFS Nonstick Carbon Steel Basting Pot, 1-quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810+m5MrRhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This everyday pot with easy-pour dual spouts is your durable grilling and kitchen staple. CHEFS nonstick basting pot has the best of all features: heavy-gauge carbon steel construction heat safe to 650 F to use on the grill or stove top and nonstick surface for easy release. Set directly on grill grate or side burner to heat sauce for basting or serving. Melt butter to drizzle on corn on the cob, vegetables or seafood. Heat and pour drawn butter into ramekins for lobster or crab. This 1 quart basting pot is just the right size to heat and serve soup or boil water. CHEFS durable, yet lightweight nonstick carbon steel saucepot heats and cooks safely with a nonstick ceramic surface that is PFOA- and PTFE-free. Ergonomic double-riveted stainless steel handle for comfortable grip. 1 quart capacity. Hand wash. CHEFS signature collection of professional-quality cookware, kitchen tools, textiles, bakeware, dinnerware and more is meticulously crafted and tested to delight the most discerning cook. CHEFS commitment to innovative, functional design is the key to delivering products of exceptional quality, performance and durability for home and professional kitchens. Product Features Durable carbon steel construction is heat safe to 650 to use on the grill, stove top and in the oven Smooth nonstick ceramic surface for easy release and effortless cleanup Heat barbecue sauce or marinade and keep within reach for grilling Easy-pour dual spouts to heat and serve soup, gravy or sauce Easily melt butter to drizzle onto vegetables, seafood or popcorn No seasoning required Ergonomic double-riveted stainless steel handle for comfortable grip Nonstick coating for easy cleanup PFOA- and PFTE-free End loop to store CHEFS signature professional-quality cookware, tools, bakeware and serveware are meticulously crafted and tested, ensuring long-lasting durability and performance in the kitchen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810+m5MrRhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEFS","source_asin":"B0134JVAAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0134JVAAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0134JVAAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
