window.products.push({"id":1165673,"name":"Sturdy Metal Bookends for Heavy Books, Tree of Life Decoration, Decorative Book Ends for Shelves Decor, Cool Office Bookends to Hold Books Heavy Duty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MwWhUC7wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⍟ BRING ZEN THROUGH CLASSY DECOR: Harmonize your space with Tree of Life metal bookend. Our unique Ying Yang stylish bookends design brings peace & class in your home office, yoga studio, meditation room with positive energy and balance. In our trendy book ends design the Tree of Life grows out of Ying & Yang symbol to relax and rest your mind. The heavy duty metal bookends authentic design makes it a focal point in the space as a bookshelf decor. ⍟ ORGANIZE YOUR SPACE: Say yes to an effortless way to organize your space with the Tree of Life bookends for vinyl records, books, heavy books, cookbooks, photo albums, encyclopedias, comics! Use the blue or black book ends as a magazine holder, book ends for records. Keep movie cases, binders, or folders in cool bookends for shelves. These non skid bookends & book holders are a cute home decor piece for an all-black bookshelf, black shelves, wood, white, etc. ⍟ HOLDS HEAVY BOOKS WITH NON-SKID BOTTOM: Functionally designed bookends for heavy books non skid provide support to hold heavy books and various sizes.. There are four laser cut gel non-skid pads on the bottom of the book stoppers to assure non- scratching protection of your shelves/ desk surface. Bookend size: round part 13cm (5.12 in), bottom pad 10 cm (3.94 in) x 9cm (3.54 in). ⍟ RIGIDNESS YOU CAN TRUST: Our round modern bookends holders for shelves will not scratch your fingers or books, This is because the bookend supports are made with sturdy book end metal using advanced technology. Meaning our tree book ends look sleek, and are hard to bend. And with the compact book end size (round part 13cm [5.12 in], bottom pad 10 cm [3.94 in] x 9cm [3.54 in]) you can use them as decorative bookends anywhere. ⍟ A THOUGHTFUL GIFT THAT AIDS TO SUSTAINABILITY: Our book holders for shelves are responsibly packed in an innovative L- shaped packaging design (reduces unnecessary packaging 5 times) instead of using a full square box. This means that our heavy bookends contribute to saving the planet from unnecessary waste. Get your pair of book ends to hold books, or treat a friend with a classy zen gift. Available in black bookends design and blue book ends design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MwWhUC7wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vitalinium","source_asin":"B0BS5792X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS5792X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS5792X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
