window.products.push({"id":1165712,"name":"Guzzini GU-2242.00-45 Feeling Butter Dish, 8-Inch, Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FkzbG4-DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Feeling 8-inch length butter dish in orange, from Guzzini. Guzzini products can be found in homes, restaurants and hotels in 85 countries throughout the world. Much of this success is due to a basic quality in the company's DNA - a curiosity for innovation. A constant striving to achieve an ideal combination of practicality and aesthetic appeal has always encouraged Guzzini to explore inquisitively, both in researching new materials and finding interesting and original design concepts. The result is a vast catalog full of all types of items for the table, the kitchen and the home. They are all beautifully designed but easy to use, very familiar, inexpensive and extremely practical. Guzzini's motto is \"designed to be used\", and this is actually the case. Guzzini colanders, containers and cutlery are not designed to be kept religiously in drawers or cupboards and only brought out on special occasions. They are to be used and re-used for daily pleasure, so that every so often you suddenly realize that you have a well-designed item in your home that makes daily living a little easier. Therefore, Guzzini's research is aimed at quality of daily life, making every moment of the day special. This quality of life also includes an appropriate relationship between the items with which we surround ourselves and their impact on the environment. Fratelli Guzzini are dedicating much effort in this regard, and will continue to do so in the future, being aware that every product should be designed keeping a sharp eye on its environmental cost. Guzzini thermoplastics can be recycled and re-used over and over again, being reborn with new shapes and colours for new uses. They become more appealing and more useful than before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FkzbG4-DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guzzini","source_asin":"B000NMMC9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NMMC9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NMMC9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165713,"name":"New Grandpa Est 2022 Coffee Mug, First Time Grandpa Gift Basket Idea, Grandfather Tea Cup 11oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JP5pDVHcL._AC_.jpg","description":"You Found it! Love This Mug: The Cute and Funny Coffee Mug She or He WILL LOVE! Novelty Coffee Mugs and Gifts - Whether this is a gift for a coffee or tea-loving friend or family member, or if you're purchasing it for yourself ... it's a great way to start the morning. Everyone loves being around people with a good sense of humor, so let this mug reveal your *fun* personality :) Besides…happiness is contagious! Who is \"Love This Mug!\" If you're looking for something cute and funny that will make you smile...(or even better...make OTHERS smile), then our mugs and gifts are sure to become some of your FAVORITES! Laughter is the best medicine...so our designs will hopefully make your day (or those you love) just a little bit better! Give the Perfect Gift that You'd Love to Receive! Keep these fun mugs and gifts in mind for: BIRTHDAYS, CHRISTMAS, VALENTINE'S DAY, MOTHER'S DAY, FATHER'S DAY, welcoming a NEW BABY to the world (especially for the proud Grandma and Grandpa!)...or any other occasion where you desire to let them know you care with a fun gift YOU'D enjoy getting :) Quality Product The mugs you get from Love This Mug are 11 ounce ceramic mugs, printed on both side and are both microwave and dishwasher safe for ease of use. Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JP5pDVHcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love This Mug","source_asin":"B0B9HX3PTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9HX3PTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9HX3PTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1165714,"name":"SHEEX Luxury Copper Sheet Set with 2 Pillowcases, Breathable PRO+Ionic Copper Fabric, Gray, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HwDhXX1UL._AC_.jpg","description":"SHEEX LUXURY COPPER Sheet Set features ultra-soft PRO+IONIC copper fabric, which releases ions that may decrease oxidants in the body. These breathable, moisture-wicking sheets keep you cool, dry and comfortable while you sleep, and the natural performance attributes in the fabric help reduce odors. Care Instructions: Use cold water and choose a regular cycle with no bleach or fabric softener and no fabric dryer sheets. Tumble dry on low, and don't worry about having to iron - SHEEX are wrinkle-resistant! --About SHEEX-- From the moment the idea for SHEEX was born, our mission has been to create the ultimate sleep experience. That mission began with the world's first soft and dreamy performance fabric bed sheet, and today we offer a complete, customizable Performance Sleep System that includes additional bedding products as well as our base-layer sleepwear collection of ultra-comfortable, effortlessly modern styles - all designed for comfort and engineered to help you get an amazing night's sleep. What makes SHEEX the best? SHEEX materials are smoother and softer and feel awesome against your skin, more so than any bedding products you have ever felt. We are the first and only performance bedding company focused on the science of sleep and recovery to help you sleep better. SHEEX is the leading innovator in next-generation solutions to create the best sleep environment possible through breathable, moisture-wicking and absolutely amazing technical fabrics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HwDhXX1UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHEEX","source_asin":"B0725KGLMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0725KGLMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0725KGLMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
