window.products.push({"id":1165829,"name":"Chimney 12412 Lyemance Damper Cap - 13 Inches x 18 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":147.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Qaync+ZLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Just what you have been waiting for, a cap that will fit over a Lyemance damper. No more swapping out dampers for a damper/cap combo product. Now you can simply just add a cap to any damper. It's simple, it's easy. Don't forget to sell a damper cap to your existing customers who own dampers the next time you clean their chimney. Features: Material: 304-alloy stainless steel. Lifetime Warranty. 24-ga. lid; 18-ga. frame. 3/4\" mesh. Specifications: Overall Dimensions: 18\" (W) x 13\" (D).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Qaync+ZLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lyemance","source_asin":"B002VFL6QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002VFL6QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002VFL6QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
