window.products.push({"id":1165886,"name":"HIC Non-Stick Fried and Poached Egg and Pancake Cooking Rings, Heart Shaped, Nonstick, PFOA and BPA Free, 4.625-Inches x 4.25-Inches, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aINyP1dNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIC Kitchen’s Non-Stick Egg Rings make perfect heart-shaped eggs the easy way. Sized perfectly for classic breakfast sandwiches, these cool gadgets double nicely as a pancake mold for uniform-sized pancakes, too! The premium non-stick coating (PFOA and BPA free) allows for healthier low-fat cooking using less oil and easier food release. Simple to use. Heat a fry pan and give the pan and the inside of each Egg Ring an ample coating of cooking oil. Place rings into the hot pan and allow them to heat up. Crack an egg into each egg ring, or spoon in pancake batter. Once cooked, lift the rings by their stay-cool handles. Perfect for fried eggs or poached eggs, and making classic breakfast foods, like eggs benedict, buttermilk pancakes, crepes, and more. The handles fold down for easy, compact storage. More than useful gadgets and gizmos, these must-have kitchen gadgets are the perfect addition to cooking tools for the all day breakfast enthusiast of all ages, especially when cooking with kids. They perform beautifully for lunch or brunch, and for making quick meals at home. Made from carbon steel with premium non-stick coating, HIC Kitchen’s Non-Stick Egg Rings are heat-resistant to 430-degrees Fahrenheit, PFOA and BPA free, durable and easy to clean. Hand wash in warm, soapy water. Set of 4 NonStick Heart Shaped Egg Rings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aINyP1dNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B01BY6FFKI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BY6FFKI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BY6FFKI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
