window.products.push({"id":1165924,"name":"ShiZu Magic Pants Hanger, A Space-Saving Closet Hanger, Multifunctional Pants Rack Hanger | Durable Closet Hanger Clothes Pants Storage Rack (Deep-Blu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HI0J+mGLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Question 1: Are these strong enough to hold heavy duty clothes?: Answer: Yes, our pants hangers are made of upgraded heavy duty stainless steel rods and quality PP ensure pants hangers sturdy and durable for long time use, strong and never deform. Question 2: How to know the correct hooks direction and install it? Why my hooks keep falling?: Answer: We have the install picture reference about the hooks in the listing and manual. Please check direction between hooks and fixed plastic part then install it. Answer: If the hook is very difficult to take off after installed, so installed direction correct. Otherwise hooks will fall off easily. Answer: For the hook and hanging rods, we have done enough experiments to prove that it can totally bear the weight of 15kg/ 33lbs, and the hanging rod will not bend, the hooks will not fall off Question 3: How to keep balance if not hang full pants at every rod? Answer: In order to keep the hanger balance, please only pull out one rod when action you are hang up/ take down clothing, don't pull out other rods. Answer: Otherwise unbalanced easy resulting in your pants on the floor. Question 4: Will these hanger wrinkled or leave a crease mark on my jeans or trousers?: Answer: No, Quality stainless steel and PP with smooth and scratch resistance, keep your ironed pants and trousers in perfect condition! Question 5: Is it difficult to get pants on and off on a daily basis?: Answer: Please don't worry. Unique open-ended rod arms and adjustable double hooks design, easy to use, quickly and easily to hang up/take down pants","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HI0J+mGLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShiZu","source_asin":"B08Q75MSWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1165924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q75MSWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q75MSWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
